      "message": "nit:\nNo concurrency group is defined. Rapid successive pushes to the same branch queue multiple independent audit runs, wasting CI resources.\n\nRecommendation:\nAdd at the job level or top-level:\n\n```\nconcurrency:\n    group: ${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}\n    cancel-in-progress: true\n```",
      "range": {
