      "side": 1,
      "message": "This triggers a full npm ci + npm audit run on every push to every branch — including Gerrit mirror refs (refs/changes/XX/YYYYY/ZZ) that GitHub receives on every patchset upload.\n\nWhy:\nOpenBMC repos are mirrored from Gerrit to GitHub. Every Gerrit patchset upload generates a push event on GitHub. With branches: [\u0027**\u0027], this workflow runs on each one, consuming GitHub Actions minutes with no additional security signal — CVE advisories are branch-independent. The existing deploy-docs-to-gh-pages.yml correctly scopes its push trigger to branches: [master].\n\nRecommendation:\n\n```\npush:\n    branches: [\u0027master\u0027]\npull_request:\n    branches: [\u0027**\u0027]\nschedule:\n    - cron: \u00270 8 * * 1\u0027\n```\n\nThe pull_request trigger already covers pre-merge review; the scheduled cron covers ongoing CVE disclosure. The push trigger only needs to gate the canonical branch.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5,
        "startChar": 8,
